  id: DOC_Now_TheQuan
  title: "Th\u1EBB c\u1EE7a Julian Vance"
  titleEn: Julian Vance's ID Badge
  year: 6
  body: "JULIAN VANCE \u2014 K\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt vi\xEAn \xE2m thanh\nC\u1ED9ng t\xE1c
    vi\xEAn \xB7 The Ashford Herald\n\nM\u1EB7t sau d\xE1n m\u1ED9t m\u1EA9u gi\u1EA5y:
    \"Alex \u2014 Evelyn \u2014 n\u1EBFu em kh\xF4ng v\u1EC1 th\xEC \u0111\u1EEBng
    \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\xE2y.\""
  bodyEn: "JULIAN VANCE \u2014 Sound Technician\nContributor \xB7 The Ashford Herald\n\nA
    note taped to the back: \"Alex \u2014 Evelyn \u2014 if I don't come back, don't
    come here.\""
  serif: 0
  flagOnRead: 0
